{"acceptance_length": 5.593220338983051, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 4, 7, 6, 7, 2, 3, 5, 3, 13, 14, 4, 4, 1, 5, 1, 4, 10, 16, 2, 2, 3, 3, 5, 6, 4, 3, 1, 1, 1, 3, 6, 11, 10, 5, 6, 12, 16, 14, 16, 1, 5, 4, 3, 1, 4, 4, 3, 2, 2, 2, 4, 5, 4, 13, 5, 6, 12, 8], "accepted_draft_lengths": [2, 3, 6, 5, 6, 1, 2, 4, 2, 12, 13, 3, 3, 0, 4, 0, 3, 9, 15, 1, 1, 2, 2, 4, 5, 3, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2, 5, 10, 9, 4, 5, 11, 15, 13, 15, 0, 4, 3, 2, 0, 3, 3, 2, 1, 1, 1, 3, 4, 3, 12, 4, 5, 11, 7], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23388434432, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23388417024, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given:\n\n- The auditorium has **4 rows** of seats.\n- Each row has **18 seats**.\n- So, the **total number of seats** is:\n  $$\n  4 \\times 18 = 72 \\text{ seats}\n  $$\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Calculate the number of seats occupied by administrators\nOne-fourth of the seats were occupied by administrators:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\nSo, **18 seats** are occupied by **administrators**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Find the number of remaining seats\nNow subtract the number of seats occupied by administrators from the total:\n\n$$\n72 - 18 = 54 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Calculate the number of seats occupied by parents\nOne-third of the remaining seats were occupied by parents:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\nSo, **18 seats** are occupied by **parents**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Find the number of seats occupied by students\nNow subtract the seats taken by administrators and parents from the total to find the number of seats occupied by students:\n\n$$\n72 - 18 (\\text{administrators}) - 18 (\\text{parents}) = 36 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{36} \\text{ students}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 2.159033332951367, "draft_calls": 59, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "16cf8c2000e8b55e51ce3c60c7707d0a98229e4818cf9471a234fa20e7bc660b", "method": "relay_svd1536", "output_hash": "d7c3a542328050bfd092e6092543ae5b14d1c08e351830091f950c8ec4e46ead", "output_tokens": 330, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23517200384, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23781703680, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1cd8fbe40f4cda30", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 373.7785277366638, "prefill_full_target": 32.904415130615234, "prefill_relay": 0.16303999722003937, "relay": 12.562368005514145, "unattributed_runtime": 29.756296753883362, "verification_full_target": 1744.782844543457}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "36", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.1939474921673536, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23781703680, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23781703680, "sampling_seed": 8507417292702617123, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 59, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03317711828276515, "turn_index": 0}
{"acceptance_length": 7.511111111111111, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 7, 6, 2, 4, 2, 7, 3, 7, 12, 2, 7, 5, 2, 7, 5, 6, 2, 5, 2, 7, 16, 8, 16, 5, 13, 1, 16, 6, 9, 8, 16, 16, 9, 16, 16, 12, 4, 9, 9, 12, 2, 1, 9, 6], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23388434432, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23388417024, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- The auditorium has **4 rows** of seats, with **18 seats in each row**.\n- **One-fourth** of the seats were occupied by **administrators**.\n- **One-third** of the **remaining** seats were occupied by **parents**.\n- The **rest** were occupied by **students**.\n\nWe are to find the number of **students**.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Find the total number of seats**\n\n$$\n\\text{Total seats} = 4 \\text{ rows} \\times 18 \\text{ seats per row} = 72 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Find the number of seats occupied by administrators**\n\n$$\n\\text{Admin seats} = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Find the remaining seats after administrators**\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining seats} = 72 - 18 = 54\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Find the number of seats occupied by parents**\n\n$$\n\\text{Parent seats} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Find the number of seats occupied by students**\n\n$$\n\\text{Student seats} = 54 - 18 = 36\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nSo, there were **36 students** in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 1.6279243151657283, "draft_calls": 45, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "eab82b2623e6203274c3eddf77e1cffe4fddcc3a71906c0dc973de921f7273d5", "output_tokens": 337, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23491826176, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23781703680, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1cd8fbe40f4cda30", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 1667.5620949827135}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "36", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 1.66